2.Name ends with a in the emp table

mysql> select empname from emp where empname like '%a';
+---------+
| empname |
+---------+
| elsa    |
| anna    |
+---------+

3.Name starts with g and ends e having 6 characters

mysql> select empname from emp where empname like 'g____e';
